{% set local_problem %}
<p>Hazel Green properties often have more tree coverage than typical suburban lots — and that means more debris in your gutters. Pine needles fall year-round. Leaves blanket everything in fall. Twigs and seeds fill in the gaps.</p>

<p>When gutters clog, water overflows. That overflow causes fascia damage, siding stains, foundation erosion, and moisture problems. The cost of these repairs dwarfs the cost of regular cleaning.</p>

<p>Professional cleaning is safer, more thorough, and frees up your time for better things than climbing ladders on a Saturday morning.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set service_explanation %}
<p>Our gutter cleaning includes: removing all debris from gutters and downspouts; clearing any clogs; flushing the system to verify proper flow; inspecting for damage or maintenance needs; and cleaning up all debris from your property.</p>

<p>For properties with heavy debris, we may recommend more frequent cleaning or discuss gutter guard options that reduce future maintenance needs.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set why_us %}
<p>We're based just 15 miles away in Huntsville and service Hazel Green regularly. We show up on time, do thorough work, and don't cut corners.</p>

<p>We also give honest advice. If you're cleaning gutters multiple times a year, we'll tell you when guards make more economic sense.</p>
{% endset %}

